      "text": "The available n=148 spells, while seemingly decent, has been a limiting factor in related studies (FAM:SF-APPS-088, FAM:SF20). Detecting the effect of a nuanced measure like 'reorganization relative to L' on a noisy outcome like points per possession might require a larger sample or more precise measurement."
